-- Awards and menu history for the rest of the open bars on the map: the ones
-- the decade seed (20260930100000) added. Same research, rules and shape as
-- 20260930900100, done on 29-30 Sep 2026; every row keeps the page it came
-- from.
--
--   awards: 663 rows for 120 bars: The World's 50 Best Bars 2009-2015
--     (the decade seed has 2016 on), Asia's 50 Best Bars 2016-2025, North
--     America's 2022-2025 (2026 is #118's), the Spirited Awards, James Beard,
--     CLASS and the Australian Bar Awards. Spelled like the decade seed; awards
--     to a person are left for the person; an award already there under
--     another spelling keeps its row.
--   menus: 338 editions for 120 bars, month and year where known. Web
--     search was spent by then, so these come from the bars' own sites, the
--     Wayback Machine and press sites fetched directly; many bars that post
--     menus only on Instagram have none.
--
-- Rows join on the profile handle, so a database without these profiles
-- inserts nothing, and a rerun inserts nothing twice.

